{"seq":3,"slug":"competitor-catalog-normalize","title":"竞品目录归一与置信度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/competitor-product-match/competitor-catalog-normalize","wordCount":2335,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"竞品目录归一与置信度\">竞品目录归一与置信度</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><a href=\"cross-site-product-match\">跨站同款识别</a> 产出的是&quot;两两关系&quot;——我的商品 A 与对手的商品 B 是同款，分数 0.93。但一个可用的比价系统需要的是&quot;目录&quot;：我要知道<strong>某个商品在市场上对应的全部竞品报价集合</strong>，才能算它的最低价、中位价、价位段排名。从关系图到目录，需要一个归一层，把散落的两两关系聚成一个稳定的竞品实体，并给这个实体上每一条边、每一个报价都挂上置信度。</p>\n<p>归一要解决三件事。<strong>聚类</strong>：如果 A 与 B 同款、B 与 C 同款，那么 A 与 C 也应同款（传递闭包），但传递闭包会放大错误——一条错的边会把两个不同款的簇粘在一起，形成&quot;簇爆炸&quot;。<strong>稳定性</strong>：新来一条边时，不能让聚类结果整体重排，否则下游引用过的主键会失效。<strong>置信度传播</strong>：簇内的整体可信度不等于任意单边的最低分，也不等于平均分，需要一个能反映证据结构的聚合方式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[match_link 两两关系] --&gt; B[边过滤 低于 tau 不入图]&#10;  B --&gt; C[连通分量/社区发现]&#10;  C --&gt; D{簇质量检查}&#10;  D --&gt;|单簇跨类目| E[拆分: 用属性/视觉再判]&#10;  D --&gt;|簇过大| E&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| F[生成 competitor_group]&#10;  F --&gt; G[簇内角色标注: 主品/变体/套装]&#10;  G --&gt; H[置信度聚合]&#10;  H --&gt; I[发布到价格对比层]&#10;  E --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[match_link 两两关系] --&gt; B[边过滤 低于 tau 不入图]\n  B --&gt; C[连通分量/社区发现]\n  C --&gt; D{簇质量检查}\n  D --&gt;|单簇跨类目| E[拆分: 用属性/视觉再判]\n  D --&gt;|簇过大| E\n  D --&gt;|通过| F[生成 competitor_group]\n  F --&gt; G[簇内角色标注: 主品/变体/套装]\n  G --&gt; H[置信度聚合]\n  H --&gt; I[发布到价格对比层]\n  E --&gt; B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归一层次</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>两两匹配</td>\n<td>商品对</td>\n<td>match_link</td>\n<td>单边误判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚类成组</td>\n<td>match_link 图</td>\n<td>competitor_group</td>\n<td>传递闭包导致簇爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角色标注</td>\n<td>组内成员</td>\n<td>主品/变体标记</td>\n<td>把套装价当主品价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>置信度聚合</td>\n<td>组内证据</td>\n<td>group_confidence</td>\n<td>高估（均值掩盖弱边）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"聚类的传递性问题\">聚类的传递性问题</h2><h3 id=\"为什么不能直接取连通分量\">为什么不能直接取连通分量</h3><p>连通分量是最简单的聚类，也是最危险的。考虑一条链 A—B—C—D，每条相邻边分数都在灰区（0.78），那么 A 与 D 的真实相似度可能很低，但连通分量把它们归为一簇。跨境商品里这种现象非常常见：一个通用配件能同时匹配上好几个不同主品，形成&quot;星形枢纽&quot;，把十几个不相关的商品拉成一簇。</p>\n<p>处理方式有两类。第一类是<strong>先剪枝再聚类</strong>：只保留分数高于较高阈值的边入图，形成多个小的、高纯度的连通分量，配合人工复核把灰区边逐步升级。第二类是<strong>用带权社区发现替代连通分量</strong>，让聚类算法在&quot;割掉一条弱边的代价&quot;与&quot;保留一簇的收益&quot;之间权衡，典型代表是对图做模块度优化的社区发现，或把超图（一条边可以连两个以上节点）用谱方法切分——非均匀超图的谱聚类方法在 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2204.13586\">Nonbacktracking spectral clustering of nonuniform hypergraphs</a>（Chodrow、Eikmeier、Haddock，2022）里给出了可计算的形式。</p>\n<p>工程上的折中是：<strong>主路径用剪枝后的连通分量，保证可解释与稳定；把&quot;簇过大&quot;作为异常信号，超过尺寸上限（例如一个簇包含多于 30 个成员）时强制进入人工复核并尝试拆分</strong>。阈值和上限都写进策略配置，随类目调整。</p>\n<h3 id=\"稳定性-主键不能抖\">稳定性：主键不能抖</h3><p>下游的价格时序、看板、规则引擎都会引用 <code>competitor_group</code> 的 ID。如果每次跑聚类都重新分配 ID，历史数据的关联就断了。可行做法是把簇 ID 做成<strong>内容派生 + 持久化映射</strong>：维护一张 <code>group_member</code> 表记录成员归属，聚类只做增量的&quot;合并/拆分/加入/移出&quot;操作，而非全量重建。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE competitor_group (&#10;  group_id      bigint PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  anchor_product_id bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES product(id),  -- 簇的主品&#10;  category      text   NOT NULL,&#10;  size          smallint NOT NULL,&#10;  confidence    numeric(4,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  state         text   NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;active&#39;,  -- active|review|split&#10;  created_at    timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  updated_at    timestamptz NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE group_member (&#10;  group_id      bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES competitor_group(group_id),&#10;  product_id    bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES product(id),&#10;  role          text   NOT NULL,   -- anchor | variant | bundle | noise&#10;  edge_evidence jsonb  NOT NULL,   -- 入组依据: 命中通道 + 分数 + 证据 hash&#10;  confidence    numeric(4,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  joined_at     timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  left_at       timestamptz,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (group_id, product_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 一个商品同时只能属于一个活跃竞品组，防止下游重复计数&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_active_member ON group_member (product_id)&#10;  WHERE left_at IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> competitor_group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  group_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  anchor_product_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product(id),  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 簇的主品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          smallint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- active|review|split</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> group_member</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  group_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> competitor_group(group_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  product_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- anchor | variant | bundle | noise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  edge_evidence jsonb  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 入组依据: 命中通道 + 分数 + 证据 hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  joined_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  left_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (group_id, product_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 一个商品同时只能属于一个活跃竞品组，防止下游重复计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_active_member</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> group_member (product_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后那条唯一索引是纪律性的：它把&quot;一个商品只属于一个竞品组&quot;变成了数据库约束，而不是靠聚类代码自觉。重复归属会让最低价计算出现幽灵折扣。</p>\n<h3 id=\"拆分与合并的触发\">拆分与合并的触发</h3><p>簇的形态会随时间变化：竞品出了新规格（拆分需求），两个原本独立的簇因为一条新证据而应合并。触发规则应当明确：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>合并</strong>：跨簇存在分数高于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的边，且合并后不跨叶子类目 → 自动合并并记录。</li>\n<li><strong>拆分</strong>：簇内出现属性强冲突（容量/颜色/包装数不一致的对）或簇规模超上限 → 标记 <code>review</code>，产出待拆清单。</li>\n<li><strong>移出</strong>：成员的价格与簇内中位数长期乖离（例如 30 天持续偏离超过 3 倍），且视觉/属性证据陈旧 → 移出并标记 <code>noise</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"置信度的定义与聚合\">置信度的定义与聚合</h2><h3 id=\"单边置信度\">单边置信度</h3><p>单条边的置信度不应只是融合分数，还应反映<strong>证据时效</strong>与<strong>证据强度</strong>。一个可用的分解是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>no_strong_id</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{edge} = s_{fuse} \\cdot \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\tau_{decay}}\\right) \\cdot \\left(1 - \\alpha \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{no\\_strong\\_id}]\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">no_strong_id</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{fuse}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是召回融合分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是证据最后一次验证距今的时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{decay}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是衰减常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>no_strong_id</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{1}[\\text{no\\_strong\\_id}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">no_strong_id</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 表示没有任何强标识符命中。这个形式让&quot;当年高分、如今未复验&quot;的边自然衰减，符合本文开头&quot;匹配关系必须有失效时间&quot;的纪律。</p>\n<h3 id=\"组级置信度-不能用平均分\">组级置信度：不能用平均分</h3><p>簇的置信度不能取成员置信度的平均，因为平均会让一条高置信边掩盖多条弱边。更合理的聚合是<strong>取簇内最弱的关键连接</strong>——类似&quot;链条强度取决于最弱环节&quot;。对于以 anchor 为中心的星形结构，可以用 anchor 到各成员的边置信度的<strong>下分位数</strong>（如 10 分位）作为组置信度，并对簇规模施加惩罚：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0.1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>M</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{group} = q_{0.1}\\{c_{edge}(anchor, m)\\}_{m \\in M} \\cdot \\left(1 - \\beta \\log \\frac{|M|}{|M|_0}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这种形式会自然惩罚&quot;大而稀&quot;的簇，与前面&quot;簇过大触发复核&quot;的规则形成呼应。下游使用时按阈值分级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组置信度</th>\n<th>下游处置</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\ge 0.90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.90</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可进自动跟价池</td>\n<td>作为最低可信竞品价的来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.70</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.70 \\le c &lt; 0.90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.70</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.90</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仅用于看板与趋势</td>\n<td>不直接触发改价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c &lt; 0.70</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.70</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仅存档</td>\n<td>不进任何对外决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条分级表是整个 hub 里&quot;置信度闸门&quot;的锚点：第 3 章的护栏规则直接引用它，第 4 章的审计也以它为追溯起点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"角色标注-别把套装价当主品价\">角色标注：别把套装价当主品价</h3><p>一个竞品组里往往混着主品、变体（不同颜色/容量）、套装（主品 + 赠品）、以及配件。它们的价格分布差异巨大，如果直接参与&quot;最低价&quot;计算，套装价或配件价会把结论带偏。因此入组时必须标注 <code>role</code>，且下游的最低可信价计算默认只取 <code>role=&#39;anchor&#39;</code> 与 <code>role=&#39;variant&#39;</code>（且变体需要按容量/规格归一，见 <a href=\"../price-intelligence-data/price-cleanse-anomaly\">价格清洗与异常/运费陷阱</a> 的单位价换算）。</p>\n<p>角色判定本身也是一个分类问题，可用特征的优先级是：属性结构化字段（包装数量、是否含赠品）&gt; 标题关键词（&quot;Bundle&quot;、&quot;Set of 2&quot;、&quot;with Case&quot;）&gt; 价格分位（套装通常显著高于组内中位）。与匹配一样，判定结果必须落库可审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量更新与成本控制\">增量更新与成本控制</h2><p>归一不是批处理任务，而是持续增量过程。新采集到一个报价时，正确的处理序列是：先用标识符做 O(1) 的组查询（若该商品已在某组内，直接复用），否则做候选召回与打分（成本高），再决定是加入现有组、创建新组还是进复核队列。这样把绝大多数流量挡在廉价路径上。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def place_product(p, ctx):&#10;    hit = ctx.group_by_strong_id(p)          # GTIN/MPN 直接命中&#10;    if hit:&#10;        return JoinExisting(hit, evidence=&quot;strong_id&quot;)&#10;    cands = ctx.recall(p, budget=50)         # 昂贵路径，限量&#10;    scored = ctx.fuse(p, cands)&#10;    top = scored[0] if scored else None&#10;    if top and top.score &gt;= ctx.tau_high:&#10;        return ctx.attach_or_merge(p, top)&#10;    if top and top.score &gt;= ctx.tau_low:&#10;        return EnqueueReview(p, top, reason=&quot;grey_zone&quot;)&#10;    return CreateGroup(p, anchor=p)          # 孤儿商品自成一组\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> place_product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p, ctx):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.group_by_strong_id(p)          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GTIN/MPN 直接命中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hit:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> JoinExisting(hit, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">evidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"strong_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cands </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.recall(p, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">budget</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 昂贵路径，限量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scored </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.fuse(p, cands)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    top </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scored[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scored </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.tau_high:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.attach_or_merge(p, top)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.tau_low:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EnqueueReview(p, top, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"grey_zone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CreateGroup(p, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">anchor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p)          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 孤儿商品自成一组</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意最后一行：孤儿商品也成组。组是&quot;市场上可比较的报价集合&quot;，哪怕暂时只有一个成员，它也应占一个组位，后续证据到达时直接扩展。这避免了&quot;新商品必须凑够两个成员才能入池&quot;这类人为延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与下游的接口\">与下游的接口</h2><p>本文的输出是 <code>competitor_group</code> 与 <code>group_member</code> 两张表加上组级置信度。下游三条链路依赖它：价格情报侧（<a href=\"../price-intelligence-data/competitor-price-timeseries\">竞品价格时序与趋势</a>、<a href=\"../price-intelligence-data/price-intel-dashboard\">竞争力情报看板</a>）按组聚合时间序列与分布；规则引擎侧（<a href=\"../repricing-rule-engine/repricing-rule-guardrail\">跟价规则与利润/品牌价护栏</a>）按置信度分级决定哪些组可以驱动改价；治理侧（<a href=\"../price-governance-anti/repricing-ops-monitor\">跟价运营审计与效果监控</a>）用入组证据回答&quot;这次比价包含了哪些对手&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>归一的任务是把两两匹配关系聚成稳定的竞品组，并给每条边与每个组挂上可解释的置信度。</li>\n<li>不能直接取连通分量：传递闭包会把枢纽商品拉成一簇；应剪枝后聚类，并把&quot;簇过大&quot;当异常信号触发复核。</li>\n<li>簇 ID 必须持久稳定（成员表 + 增量合并/拆分），并用唯一索引保证一个商品只属于一个活跃组。</li>\n<li>组置信度不能取平均；应以 anchor 到成员边置信度的下分位数为基，并对簇规模施加惩罚，避免&quot;大而稀&quot;的簇。</li>\n<li>入组必须标注角色（主品/变体/套装/配件），否则套装价与配件价会污染最低可信价。</li>\n<li>组置信度分级是下游的闸门：高置信才可驱动自动改价，中置信只进看板，低置信仅存档。</li>\n<li>归一要增量执行：强标识符 O(1) 命中优先，昂贵召回限量，孤儿商品也自成一组以保证后续可扩展。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"竞品目录归一与置信度","id":"竞品目录归一与置信度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"聚类的传递性问题","id":"聚类的传递性问题"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能直接取连通分量","id":"为什么不能直接取连通分量"},{"level":3,"text":"稳定性：主键不能抖","id":"稳定性-主键不能抖"},{"level":3,"text":"拆分与合并的触发","id":"拆分与合并的触发"},{"level":2,"text":"置信度的定义与聚合","id":"置信度的定义与聚合"},{"level":3,"text":"单边置信度","id":"单边置信度"},{"level":3,"text":"组级置信度：不能用平均分","id":"组级置信度-不能用平均分"},{"level":3,"text":"角色标注：别把套装价当主品价","id":"角色标注-别把套装价当主品价"},{"level":2,"text":"增量更新与成本控制","id":"增量更新与成本控制"},{"level":2,"text":"与下游的接口","id":"与下游的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"价格采集渠道与合规边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/competitor-product-match/price-scrape-compliance"},"next":{"title":"价格清洗与异常/运费陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/price-intelligence-data/price-cleanse-anomaly"}}